        "translator": "K. M. K. Murthy / Desiraju Hanumanta Rao",
        "text": "\"My father is Sage Vibhandaka and I am his true descent son. I am known as Rishyasringa, by my name and by an event on my birth, and thus renowned on earth...\""
      }
